.nh
.TH "PB-RECIPE-SHOW" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-recipe-show - Show a recipe, its file and its machines


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb recipe show <name> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one recipe: its revision, public token id, expiry and creator, the file as it
was created or last updated (comments kept), and every machine paired from it with
whether it is online, which revision it applied and any section that failed to
apply.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for show

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-recipe(1)\fP
